    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728950/extras/e64a3238eda726189f8337761b33b1dd.avif?t=1718796459\" width=550 height=200 /></span><br>A player described this game as &quot;Dark Souls meets Mario.&quot;<br>It's quite an amusing analogy, and surprisingly accurate too.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Wanted</h2>For hazardous journey, bitter condition, long months of complete darkness, constant danger, safe return doubtful, honor and recognition in case of success.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POTTY Knight Saga</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728950/extras/8ec79c485a47f044833065746703b265.avif?t=1718796459\" width=512 height=512 /></span><br>Potty Knight Saga is a platformer action game heavily focused on very difficult level design. <br>This game is so simple. easy for anyone to play and focused on playing fun.<br>But it's not easy to clear this game<br><br><strong>Developer's words</strong><br>Korean gamer's talent is already recognized not only in Korea but in the world-wide<br>What those Korean gamers said the most after playing in the biggest game show in Korea<br><br>Scream! Real Screaming!!<br><br>The developer of this game spoke confidently<br>&quot;Does this game look cute?, But this game is the pinnacle of the challenge&quot;<br><br>And a word that's hidden inside<br>&quot;I'm looking forward to your screams :)&quot;<br><br>So what kind of game is it?<br>The controls are simple but It's an adventure game with a very difficult level!<br><br>Can you overcome this game?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features, Summarized:</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The various enemies and traps that stand in your way</strong></li></ul>The various pitfalls of this game make it fun. Of course, it makes you scream<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rich in atmosphere</strong></li></ul>Outstanding! Every scenes that feel unique and charming at a glance<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Creedence but Difficult to master</strong></li></ul>You can be easy to enjoy game immediately without advance information.<br>But We need a strategy to counter them.",
